@crew achterberg-lars
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Evening, cadet. Achterberg, night Watch. If something's on fire, there's a form.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. All quiet. Suspiciously quiet. Chapter two of a mystery quiet.   #funny
- {me}. Form filled in? Good. You'll go far.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Good to see a face I'd trust with the paperwork.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Quiet night, tidy forms, and I guessed the ending by page ten.
? mood:low
- Long night. A form went missing. I found it. In the wrong drawer. Mine.
== near
? habit:bar-regular
- One drink, one chapter, and bed. That's a good evening.
? act:meal
- Take your time. Meals are the only thing on this ship that isn't urgent.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I know every song in the record cabinet. Ask four others. They disagree.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- A good mystery. I guess the ending early. Then I enjoy being right for two hundred pages.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. My shift's done. Nothing happened. I've filed a form saying so.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}. You've been missing. I was about to open a case. With a form.   #funny

== near
? habit:stargazer
- The observatory. A mystery with no last page. I find that very restful.
? deck:2 time:night
- Night patrol, Deck 2. Every door shut. I check twice. Then once more, for luck.

== invite
- Tiles tonight? I'll explain the rules slowly. Then lose quickly.   #funny
? tier>=colleague
- Friday jam. I'll sing the right words. Torres will sing other ones. Come and judge.   #funny

== accept
- {yes}. I'll be there at the time on the form.
- Good. Yes. I'll bring a chapter in case it's slow.

== decline
- Not tonight. Night Watch. Somebody has to be calm at three in the morning.
? weekday:sun|mon
- Rest day. A call home and a mystery. Probably in that order. Tuesday?

== missed
- You missed it. I've made a note. Not a form. I'm not a monster.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I'd guess your present, but I'd ruin it. I always do.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Moreau gave me a mystery with the ending circled. I've been had.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's in. Stay calm, stay put. There's a form for afterwards. There always is.   #funny

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I'd like to talk. No form needed.

== about
? aff:moreau-signe:friend
- Moreau and I swap mysteries and spoil them. Best friendship I have aboard.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- {bye}. Lock your locker. Not for any reason. Habit.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:night
- {me}. It's late. You look like a suspect in chapter one. Go to bed.   #funny
== life
? tier>=friend
- I call home on rest days. Dad reads me the ending of whatever he's reading. On purpose.   #funny
- Calm's not a gift. It's practice. I practise on forms.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Chapter two. I know who did it.   #funny
- There's a form for that.   #funny
- Every song in the cabinet. Right words.
? act:meal
- Take your time. Meals aren't urgent.
? act:off
- Mystery, call home, bed. In that order.
?

== rumour
- Calmly: this happened.
- Spoiler. Sorry. Here it is.   #funny
